{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20328","headline":"西州 · 张籍","name":"西州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羌胡据西州，近甸无边城。\n山东收税租，养我防塞兵。\n胡骑来无时，居人常震惊。\n嗟我五陵间，农者罢耘耕。\n边头多杀伤，士卒难全形。\n郡县发丁役，丈夫各征行。\n生男不能养，惧身有姓名。\n良马不念秣，烈士不苟营。\n所愿除国难，再逢天下平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}